> c1(x: u8) = x*x where x >= 3 && x <= 9
> c2(x: u8) = x*x + (x & 16) where x >= 3 && x <= 9
> equiv c1 ~ c2
c1 and c2 are equal on the domain of c1 (exhaustive)
  domain: x in 3..9 by the where clause (7 points enumerated)
> domain c1
domain of c1:
  x: u8, 0..255
  where x >= 3 && x <= 9
  no conditions: total on its parameter types
  defined at 7 of 7 points
  over all 7 points of the domain
> range c1
range of c1 -> u8:
  9..81   (7 distinct values)
  values: 9, 16, 25, 36, 49, 64, 81
  fits in u7
  over all 7 points of the domain
